msgid ""
"For modules without an on-board compass, the orientation does not matter as "
"long as the square antenna side is facing up"
msgstr "对于不带板载罗盘的模块，方向无关紧要，只需确保方形天线面朝上即可"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:22
#: 028d2be8e4f24a2fbdf2051e12a533a2 0f1d160c9aaf4649ae71d681b91794b1
