#: e1e4de998b4149ddaf83f578f8d8af5d
msgid ""
"The GPS should have a clear view of the sky and not be under spinning "
"propellers"
msgstr "GPS 应有清晰的天空视野，不应位于旋转的螺旋桨下方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mounting-the-gps-module.rst:24
#: 182ba02ec6f5418ba7c735ef85655360 1d1d771976154e3786a6cf1c4860d5c7
#: 36a021fb1cd5495cbcc59519e2033be3 63c3b5dcfb4145b0bb63fb6f78a66be4
#: 99e251697b7241019061ef3b5c737e3e
msgid ""
"It should be mounted as far away as possible from radio transmission "
"equipment (telemetry, video transmitters), motors, and ESCs."
msgstr "应尽量远离无线电发射设备（数传、图传发射机）、电机和 ESC。"

